# Components & Accessibility

- Follow `docs/COMPONENT_INVENTORY.md` naming and folders (`brand`, `layout`, `ui`, `marketing`, `knowledge`, `tools`, `loaders`).
- Every interactive control needs keyboard access and visible `:focus-visible` styles.
- Icon-only controls require accessible names. Bottom nav items include text labels.
- Forms: associate labels, show errors, success/empty/error states.
- Do not build ~187 one-off pages — use reusable templates + typed content.
